    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chinese gaming club is a simulation adventure game. Player acts as a founder of an esports club that make their way from a local small club to the best gaming club of the world.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243960/extras/39e71c6e542651180a224411a0dd0e88.avif?t=1727376111\" width=800 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0The game has rich story line and plentiful of characters\u3002During the development of the game, player gets a chance to explore different parts of China and trigger different storylines.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243960/extras/6a500b7d852e73d07d8674f02d3f42b2.avif?t=1727376111\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In different parts of China, player undergo different adventures and challenge different mini-games.\u00a0 Once players overcome different adventures, they will obtain different skills that help them become better esports players that can defeat stronger opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243960/extras/4f284c3cc83da025d269b8834bfbdbdd.avif?t=1727376111\" width=800 height=440 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During match day, player fights stronger and stronger enmies, player will enhance their capabilities and eventually make their way to the highest league of the world.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243960/extras/c794a938afa51bfd7137fa5aa0d2405a.avif?t=1727376111\" width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different fighting system will be available throughout the game. Player will experince diffferent type of fighting and defeat a variety of characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243960/extras/109abc107562f5f73d688b05313b9805.avif?t=1727376111\" width=800 height=440 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a simulation game, business money management content is also available. The game club will start earning income after chapter two of the storyline.\u00a0 Two shops will be unlocked. Players will make careful decisions regarding how to use their money effectively to enhance their players as well as make the club financially healthy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243960/extras/a1b7b386f8a801b80eb60ad7785300de.avif?t=1727376111\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is very rich in storyline, through out the game, players will walk through tens of chapters of stories. Hidden chapters can be triggered through completing difficult adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243960/extras/9d6d982dff40536037272a1977c3d37f.avif?t=1727376111\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In chapter 4, players will also represent their country to national gaming competitions. They will not only win glory for their club but their nation as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243960/extras/612fa0eaf6ab517d11a1556d90baa8f2.avif?t=1727376111\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243960/extras/6b821078567a2224c896789aeece6b29.avif?t=1727376111\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243960/extras/6c78710adbcef1824b719b6998319a06.avif?t=1727376111\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span>during branch of the storyline,\u00a0 protagonists of the game will meet and talk with successful people of all fields including other esports players, famous atheletes and successful bussiness men. These adventures will enhance statistics of players and add incomes to the club make players stronger and the club more successful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243960/extras/f7cd2571eaf4f27ac393934b6fd40b2c.avif?t=1727376111\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243960/extras/e4bcfb797bab71d694830f58a3bae926.avif?t=1727376111\" data-has-big width=800 height=532 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through hours of hard work, player will conquer many gaming leagues and eventually win the biggest gaming match of the world.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chinese gaming club is a simulation adventure game. Player acts as a founder of an esports club that make their way from a local small club to the best gaming club of the world.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243960/extras/39e71c6e542651180a224411a0dd0e88.avif?t=1727376111\" width=800 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0The game has rich story line and plentiful of characters\u3002During the development of the game, player gets a chance to explore different parts of China and trigger different storylines.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243960/extras/6a500b7d852e73d07d8674f02d3f42b2.avif?t=1727376111\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In different parts of China, player undergo different adventures and challenge different mini-games.\u00a0 Once players overcome different adventures, they will obtain different skills that help them become better esports players that can defeat stronger opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243960/extras/4f284c3cc83da025d269b8834bfbdbdd.avif?t=1727376111\" width=800 height=440 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During match day, player fights stronger and stronger enmies, player will enhance their capabilities and eventually make their way to the highest league of the world.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243960/extras/c794a938afa51bfd7137fa5aa0d2405a.avif?t=1727376111\" width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different fighting system will be available throughout the game. Player will experince diffferent type of fighting and defeat a variety of characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243960/extras/109abc107562f5f73d688b05313b9805.avif?t=1727376111\" width=800 height=440 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a simulation game, business money management content is also available. The game club will start earning income after chapter two of the storyline.\u00a0 Two shops will be unlocked. Players will make careful decisions regarding how to use their money effectively to enhance their players as well as make the club financially healthy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243960/extras/a1b7b386f8a801b80eb60ad7785300de.avif?t=1727376111\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is very rich in storyline, through out the game, players will walk through tens of chapters of stories. Hidden chapters can be triggered through completing difficult adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243960/extras/9d6d982dff40536037272a1977c3d37f.avif?t=1727376111\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In chapter 4, players will also represent their country to national gaming competitions. They will not only win glory for their club but their nation as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243960/extras/612fa0eaf6ab517d11a1556d90baa8f2.avif?t=1727376111\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243960/extras/6b821078567a2224c896789aeece6b29.avif?t=1727376111\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243960/extras/6c78710adbcef1824b719b6998319a06.avif?t=1727376111\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span>during branch of the storyline,\u00a0 protagonists of the game will meet and talk with successful people of all fields including other esports players, famous atheletes and successful bussiness men. These adventures will enhance statistics of players and add incomes to the club make players stronger and the club more successful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243960/extras/f7cd2571eaf4f27ac393934b6fd40b2c.avif?t=1727376111\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243960/extras/e4bcfb797bab71d694830f58a3bae926.avif?t=1727376111\" data-has-big width=800 height=532 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through hours of hard work, player will conquer many gaming leagues and eventually win the biggest gaming match of the world.</p>",
